message: >-
  If you use Noodle Biomedical Literature Discovery MCP, please cite this
  software using the metadata below.
title: Noodle Biomedical Literature Discovery MCP
type: software
authors:
  - name: Helena Bioinformatics
    website: https://www.helena.bio
version: 0.2.0
date-released: 2026-08-29
url: https://noodle.helena.bio/mcp
repository-code: https://github.com/helena-bioinformatics/noodle-mcp
license: Apache-2.0
keywords:
  - biomedical literature search
  - publication discovery
  - citation graph
  - semantic literature graph
  - PubMed
  - Model Context Protocol
  - bioinformatics
abstract: >-
  Public read-only MCP adapter for source-linked biomedical literature search,
  publication records, corpus metadata, and bounded citation or semantic graph
  traversal. The service accepts public non-sensitive questions and identifiers
  only and does not establish causality, diagnosis, or treatment.
